itself as [app.package] (was [app.dependency-checker]). The installed app keeps its name, its launcher
bc250-portal-dependency-checker, its folder under ~/.local/share, its settings, and the Bazzite update reminder's
timer, which starts the launcher; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the new key.

